  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil or ghee in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery and saut\u00166 over until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the sliced almonds and cook for 2-3 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the crushed amaretti and cook for 1 minute, until the mixture is lightly browned.",
    "Add the wine and cook until the liquid has almost completely evaporated.",
    "Add the cooked basmati rice to the skillet and stir to combine with the vegetable and almond mixture.",
    "Season with salt to taste and garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "Transfer the biryani to a serving dish and serve hot."
